-- ===========================================================================
-- AgriScan AI — extended optional seed data (PostgreSQL 16)
--
-- ~200 rows in the parent `scans` table + child rows (scan_pipeline_steps,
-- scan_detections), plus richer reference data (articles, guides, sections).
--
-- Generated by db/generate_seed.js (deterministic — same output every run).
-- Idempotent: every INSERT uses ON CONFLICT ... DO NOTHING so this file can
-- be re-run safely on top of the base schema seed (A841 etc. are preserved).
--
-- Run order matters for FK integrity:
--   users -> crops -> articles -> guides -> guide_sections -> scans ->
--   scan_pipeline_steps -> scan_detections
-- ===========================================================================

